---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="EPC & Legionella Guide | Scottish Energy Services"
  description="Learn what EPC (RdSAP) and Legionella risk assessments are, and when landlords or homeowners typically need them."
>
  <section class="hero-section">
    <div class="container-pro py-10 md:py-16">
      <p class="badge">Assessment guide</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">What are EPC and Legionella certificates, and when do you need them?</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">
        A quick guide for landlords, agents, and homeowners to understand both services before requesting a quote.
      </p>
      <a href="/#quote" class="btn-primary mt-6">Back to live quote</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-16">
    <div class="container-pro space-y-6">
      <article class="quote-card">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">EPC (RdSAP) assessment</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">
          An EPC (Energy Performance Certificate) rates a property's energy efficiency from A to G. RdSAP is the standard method
          used for existing homes in Scotland and the wider UK.
        </p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">When you might need an EPC</h3>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-5 text-slate-700 space-y-1">
          <li>Before marketing a property for sale or rent.</li>
          <li>When an existing EPC has expired (most are valid for 10 years).</li>
          <li>When you want energy-efficiency recommendations for upgrades.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="quote-card">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Legionella risk assessment</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">
          A Legionella risk assessment checks a property's water systems for conditions that can increase the risk of Legionella
          bacteria growth.
        </p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">When you might need a Legionella assessment</h3>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-5 text-slate-700 space-y-1">
          <li>As part of landlord health and safety responsibilities.</li>
          <li>For properties with stored water tanks, little-used outlets, or complex plumbing.</li>
          <li>When there is a change in tenancy or property management policy.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="quote-card">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">How pricing works in the live quote</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5 text-slate-700 space-y-1">
          <li>EPC prices depend on property type: Flat £70, House £85, Bungalow £80, Maisonette £75.</li>
          <li>Legionella risk assessment is charged per property when selected.</li>
          <li>For locations outside Glasgow and Edinburgh, an additional travel premium is added.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
